WEBVTT

00:01:32.340 --> 00:01:35.010
Do you like someone?

00:01:35.480 --> 00:01:36.260
Huh?

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:38.680
I guess...

00:01:40.190 --> 00:01:41.500
Are you going out with her?

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:42.280
No...

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:48.320
That means I still have a chance.

00:01:51.890 --> 00:01:54.030
I like you.

00:01:55.030 --> 00:01:56.780
I like you, Hiroki.

00:02:08.680 --> 00:02:11.680
Elis, Why are you sleeping here?

00:02:17.890 --> 00:02:20.450
Onii-chan, you're such a pervert.

00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:22.030
I'm not a pervert.

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:23.410
Why are you dressed like that?

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:27.020
I couldn't find my pajamas
in my luggage.

00:02:27.020 --> 00:02:29.910
That doesn't explain why you're
sleeping in my room.

00:02:29.910 --> 00:02:32.810
But it's colder than Hokkaido here.

00:02:32.810 --> 00:02:35.430
We don't turn on the heat
at night. Besides...

00:02:35.430 --> 00:02:37.000
What is it?

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:39.600
You're warm.

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:40.880
See? You're warm.

00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:42.270
Cut it out.

00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:43.170
You can't stop me.

00:02:43.170 --> 00:02:46.290
Elis, do you intend to arrive
late on your first day?

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:48.460
Is it time already?

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:49.860
It is.

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:51.780
Five more minutes.

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:53.140
Hey, get up.

00:02:53.140 --> 00:02:54.790
No way.

00:02:56.330 --> 00:02:58.390
No fair, Onii-chan.

00:02:58.390 --> 00:03:00.370
What's not fair?

00:03:00.370 --> 00:03:04.440
You were so kind a minute ago.

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:06.530
A minute ago?

00:03:06.530 --> 00:03:09.140
What have you been dreaming about?

00:03:09.140 --> 00:03:11.010
I can't tell you.

00:03:11.010 --> 00:03:12.940
It's embarrassing.

00:03:13.890 --> 00:03:15.040
Stupid.

00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:17.940
Breakfast's ready.

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:18.920
Okay.

00:03:21.290 --> 00:03:23.060
I hate ketchup.

00:03:23.060 --> 00:03:23.890
Okay, okay.

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:25.060
Onii-chan.

00:03:25.060 --> 00:03:25.920
What?

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:28.950
What do you think?

00:03:30.300 --> 00:03:32.030
You look fine.

00:03:32.030 --> 00:03:33.390
Hurry up and eat.

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:37.400
Delicious.

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:41.670
I wish you could be my housewife.

00:03:41.670 --> 00:03:43.630
What are you talking about?

00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:45.240
Here, have a tomato.

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:48.700
You really are a picky eater.

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:50.240
Classic Red Prohibition

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:54.950
You didn't have to come.

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:57.720
Well, I am your guardian.

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:58.820
Eleventh Nadesico Academy High
School Entrance Ceremony

00:03:57.720 --> 00:03:58.820
Fine, fine.

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:00.210
I'll meet you here.

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:01.050
Okay.

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:08.260
And now a word from
the superintendent.

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:09.230
Bow.

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:12.830
Good morning, everyone!

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:16.280
I am acting superintendent
Saginomiya Saya.

00:04:16.970 --> 00:04:20.600
I am here in place of the
superintendent today.

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:24.370
Congratulations on your acceptance...

00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:26.610
to the prestigious Nadesico
Academy High School.

00:04:32.230 --> 00:04:34.410
Dad, Mom...

00:04:35.730 --> 00:04:42.060
...and we hope you will have fruitful
experiences at our school.

00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:48.470
Be nice to your classmates.

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:50.390
I'm not a little kid.

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:52.070
You look like a kid to me.

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:57.290
I've grown in a lot of ways.

00:04:57.290 --> 00:04:58.180
What?

00:04:58.180 --> 00:05:00.320
I'll stop by the Art Club later.

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:01.210
See you there.

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:03.950
Don't think you can slack off
just because I'm the advisor.

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:05.640
I know.

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:09.300
There are plenty of artistically
talented students...

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:11.380
in Nadesico Academy's middle school,
high school, and college.

00:05:11.380 --> 00:05:14.530
This environment is perfect for her.

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:18.960
We invited her to our school
as an art student...

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:22.550
and we intend to support
her in any way we can.

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:24.540
Thank you.

00:05:26.490 --> 00:05:29.740
Nurture gifted students.

00:05:30.070 --> 00:05:32.530
That is our superintendent's wish.

00:05:33.340 --> 00:05:36.410
I may only be the acting superintendent,
but it is my wish as well.

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:37.850
I understand.

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:38.970
Excuse me.

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:43.260
Kamikura-san.

00:05:43.260 --> 00:05:44.220
Yes?

00:05:44.220 --> 00:05:49.730
I was hoping to hang a new painting
in the superintendent's office.

00:05:49.730 --> 00:05:52.330
Could you paint something for me?

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:56.100
I...

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:59.730
I know you are busy with
your college courses...

00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:02.570
and helping with the art club, but...

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:08.380
Excuse me.

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:10.210
I do not need it right away.

00:06:12.550 --> 00:06:15.490
Someday, I am sure...

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:27.790
There you are, Hagino.

00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:29.060
Long time no see.

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:31.070
Nice to see you again, Sensei.

00:06:31.380 --> 00:06:33.920
I'm not a teacher yet.

00:06:33.920 --> 00:06:36.110
I won't be one for another year.

00:06:36.110 --> 00:06:37.560
I know.

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:39.570
Who was that girl?

00:06:39.570 --> 00:06:41.040
What girl?

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:42.890
The girl you arrived with this morning.

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:45.590
Oh, you mean Elis.

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:47.250
She's something like a sister.

00:06:47.250 --> 00:06:48.910
Of course.

00:06:48.910 --> 00:06:50.860
What was that about?

00:06:50.860 --> 00:06:53.290
May I ask one more thing?

00:06:53.290 --> 00:06:54.390
Go ahead.

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:56.000
When kissing your girlfriend...

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:57.850
do you wordlessly go in for the kiss...

00:06:57.850 --> 00:07:00.490
or do you ask for permission first?

00:07:00.490 --> 00:07:02.500
I don't know.

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:05.510
I don't have a girlfriend.

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:08.310
I see.

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:10.990
Thank you.

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:12.350
See you later.

00:07:15.300 --> 00:07:18.050
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:34.170
Sensei.

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:36.310
I'm not a teacher.

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:38.110
I'm the art club's acting advisor.

00:07:38.110 --> 00:07:39.100
I know.

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:42.040
Do you need something, Takeuchi?

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:45.980
If you have the time, could
you come teach the club?

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:48.560
All right, I got it.

00:07:56.070 --> 00:07:56.990
Takeuchi.

00:07:56.990 --> 00:07:57.940
Yes.

00:07:57.940 --> 00:07:59.520
Nothing's wrong with your form.

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:02.020
Think about your shadow's value
contrast some more.

00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:04.400
Tighten up your dark areas,
and it'll look even better.

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:05.200
Yes.

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:08.230
Sakuma, check your forms again.

00:08:08.230 --> 00:08:08.910
Yes.

00:08:08.910 --> 00:08:09.450
Tachiki.

00:08:09.450 --> 00:08:10.110
Yes.

00:08:10.110 --> 00:08:13.740
Reconsider your composition and establish
your points of emphasis.

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:14.540
Yes.

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:16.270
That's all.

00:08:16.270 --> 00:08:18.230
Thank you.

00:08:19.030 --> 00:08:20.100
Next.

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:21.710
Onii-chan.

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:22.850
Who are you?

00:08:23.590 --> 00:08:26.010
I'm here to observe the club.

00:08:26.010 --> 00:08:27.040
I see.

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:28.420
I am the club president Takeuchi.

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:30.980
The “Watercolor Devil!”

00:08:30.980 --> 00:08:31.540
What?

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:33.080
You're Takeuchi Mami-san, aren't you?

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:36.060
I've seen your work and name
all over competitions.

00:08:36.060 --> 00:08:38.960
I always thought only a devil could
use watercolors this well.

00:08:41.930 --> 00:08:44.980
Hey, make sure you introduce yourself.

00:08:45.490 --> 00:08:47.370
I am Hosen Elis.

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:50.440
Is she your sister, Kamikura-sensei?

00:08:50.440 --> 00:08:55.070
She's my cousin, but I've known
her since she was born.

00:08:55.070 --> 00:08:56.360
I'm basically her brother.

00:08:56.360 --> 00:08:59.250
Onii-chan, I didn't know
they call you Sensei.

00:08:59.250 --> 00:09:00.360
Just call me by my name.

00:09:00.360 --> 00:09:01.320
I'm your acting advisor.

00:09:01.780 --> 00:09:04.370
And keep your distance at school.

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:06.630
Understood.

00:09:06.630 --> 00:09:08.330
President, I went and bought them.

00:09:09.180 --> 00:09:10.760
Is this what you wanted?

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:13.160
Very good. Thank you.

00:09:14.060 --> 00:09:17.650
I'm thinking of using these
as this week's subject.

00:09:17.650 --> 00:09:20.320
Classic red roses. Sounds good.

00:09:20.730 --> 00:09:23.170
Hosen-san, instead of just observing...

00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:24.610
why don't you paint with us?

00:09:25.740 --> 00:09:26.740
What's wrong?

00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:28.990
I don't want to paint.

00:09:29.360 --> 00:09:30.180
Elis.

00:09:32.020 --> 00:09:34.690
I don't want to paint those roses.

00:09:34.690 --> 00:09:40.610
Hosen-san, our club chooses a new subject
every week for everyone to paint.

00:09:40.610 --> 00:09:43.380
That way, we inspire each other.

00:09:43.380 --> 00:09:45.150
Elis, that's how it is.

00:09:45.150 --> 00:09:46.320
Don't be so stubborn.

00:09:46.320 --> 00:09:48.470
But Onii-chan, I don't
want to paint them!

00:09:57.310 --> 00:10:01.370
Elis, if you're done observing
the club, go home.

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:09.750
I'm coming in.

00:10:13.080 --> 00:10:15.180
You still haven't changed?

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:18.820
What are you sulking for?

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:21.570
I'm not sulking.

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:24.980
Why don't you want to paint roses?

00:10:24.980 --> 00:10:26.500
It's not that I don't want to.

00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:27.900
If you're going to join the art club...

00:10:27.900 --> 00:10:29.590
try to get along with everyone.

00:10:29.590 --> 00:10:33.010
And stop calling me Onii-chan
in front of everyone.

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:34.950
Fine.

00:10:34.950 --> 00:10:37.610
We're having curry for dinner today.

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:40.920
I thought you like it. Aren't
you going to eat?

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:43.850
Of course I'll eat.

00:10:44.860 --> 00:10:45.830
Come on.

00:10:48.780 --> 00:10:49.820
Tomorrow...

00:10:50.490 --> 00:10:53.310
Tomorrow I'll make dinner.

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:57.430
I can't let you do all the work.

00:10:57.430 --> 00:10:59.030
Thanks.

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:01.280
Onii-chan.

00:11:01.530 --> 00:11:02.610
What?

00:11:02.610 --> 00:11:04.580
Start painting again.

00:11:06.900 --> 00:11:08.580
This again?

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:12.750
I started painting because of you.

00:11:12.750 --> 00:11:15.500
I can't believe you would stop painting.

00:11:16.550 --> 00:11:20.260
It's not easy to make a living painting.

00:11:20.260 --> 00:11:23.190
That's why I decided to graduate from
the education department...

00:11:23.190 --> 00:11:25.580
and become an art teacher.

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:29.130
An art teacher can paint, too!

00:11:30.020 --> 00:11:33.350
Onii-chan, why did you stop painting?

00:11:39.620 --> 00:11:41.710
Go wash your hands.

00:12:04.670 --> 00:12:06.100
You did this, didn't you?

00:12:06.100 --> 00:12:07.020
I did not!

00:12:07.020 --> 00:12:08.300
You should apologize!

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:10.170
I don't want to apologize!

00:12:10.170 --> 00:12:11.680
Calm down, everyone.

00:12:14.570 --> 00:12:16.540
Isn't this your painting, Takeuchi?

00:12:16.930 --> 00:12:17.680
Yes.

00:12:18.080 --> 00:12:19.450
What happened to it?

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:21.980
It was Hosen-san.

00:12:24.990 --> 00:12:26.720
Did you do this, Elis?

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:28.950
I didn't do it!

00:12:28.950 --> 00:12:32.710
I can't believe they would suspect
me without proof!

00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:35.130
These people don't deserve to paint!

00:12:35.130 --> 00:12:37.080
Elis, you've gone too far.

00:12:37.080 --> 00:12:39.790
Are you siding with them, Onii-chan?

00:12:39.790 --> 00:12:41.070
Don't call me that.

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:55.440
So much for your painting.

00:12:55.440 --> 00:12:57.810
I will just paint it again.

00:12:57.810 --> 00:13:00.660
I'm fine. Let's get this cleaned up.

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:03.680
Painting red roses blue.

00:13:03.680 --> 00:13:05.960
She must hate painting the same
thing as everyone else.

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:07.400
After all, she's a special student.

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:09.500
Blue roses?

00:13:09.500 --> 00:13:11.180
This is Hosen-san's painting.

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:15.210
Did anyone see Hosen break the vase?

00:13:19.120 --> 00:13:23.840
She runs her mouth, but she isn't a liar.

00:13:24.520 --> 00:13:26.850
I'm sure of it.

00:13:32.060 --> 00:13:33.700
Oh, Hagino.

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:34.720
What a coincidence.

00:13:34.720 --> 00:13:36.030
What's that supposed to mean?

00:13:36.030 --> 00:13:37.760
Do you have more questions for me?

00:13:37.760 --> 00:13:38.810
No.

00:13:38.810 --> 00:13:41.470
It seems the art club
is having a problem.

00:13:41.470 --> 00:13:42.600
How did you know?

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:44.880
I hear things.

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:47.140
Gathering information is important.

00:13:47.360 --> 00:13:48.940
What are you, a detective?

00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:52.010
I'd like to try my hand at writing
mysteries someday.

00:13:52.340 --> 00:13:52.940
What?

00:13:52.940 --> 00:13:57.880
The broken vase, the scattered red roses,
and the painting of blue roses.

00:13:59.350 --> 00:14:02.050
What are they hiding?

00:14:02.050 --> 00:14:03.870
Figure it out for me.

00:14:03.870 --> 00:14:05.980
What is my reward?

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:08.180
You'll get it once this is solved.

00:14:08.180 --> 00:14:09.890
What should I ask for?

00:14:09.890 --> 00:14:11.860
I can't afford anything expensive.

00:14:11.860 --> 00:14:13.630
I'm a starving student.

00:14:13.630 --> 00:14:15.610
Come on, you cheapskate.

00:14:15.610 --> 00:14:16.760
Come on, yourself.

00:14:16.760 --> 00:14:18.920
I'm always answering your questions.

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:19.900
Cut me some slack.

00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:21.290
What does that mean?

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:23.040
You don't like answering my questions?

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:26.980
It's Hikari-chan.

00:14:33.980 --> 00:14:34.690
Hey.

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:35.900
Out shopping?

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:37.890
Yes.

00:14:38.820 --> 00:14:39.800
What's wrong?

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:41.530
What did you buy?

00:14:43.050 --> 00:14:44.730
Such suspicious behavior.

00:14:45.240 --> 00:14:46.190
Let's see.

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:47.330
Stop.

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:49.030
If it breaks again...

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:52.440
Is that a vase?

00:14:53.720 --> 00:14:54.870
Yes.

00:14:55.760 --> 00:14:57.810
You went and bought a new one.

00:14:57.810 --> 00:15:01.320
Why don't we have a
chat over some tea.

00:15:01.700 --> 00:15:03.150
Right, Sensei?

00:15:03.150 --> 00:15:04.410
Sensei...

00:15:04.410 --> 00:15:06.110
I'm not a teacher.

00:15:06.110 --> 00:15:07.440
We know.

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:11.890
I'm sorry, I broke it!

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:12.770
What?

00:15:12.770 --> 00:15:15.040
I was just trying to change
the water in the vase.

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:18.370
Then why was Elis under suspicion?

00:15:18.370 --> 00:15:22.680
Hosen-san had arrived at the
room first and was painting.

00:15:22.680 --> 00:15:25.710
She was there when I
broke the vase, too.

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:30.170
I accidentally splashed water
on the president's painting.

00:15:30.630 --> 00:15:32.710
When I was wondering what
I should do, Hosen-san...

00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:37.580
It was such a beautiful watercolor, too.

00:15:43.510 --> 00:15:46.610
Don't worry, she'll forgive
you if you apologize.

00:15:46.610 --> 00:15:48.740
Let's clean this up together.

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:52.700
I couldn't admit to doing it.

00:15:53.880 --> 00:15:58.180
Hosen-san didn't rat me out either.

00:15:58.760 --> 00:16:00.830
What was Elis thinking?

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:03.540
All right, case closed.

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:05.450
I'm sorry.

00:16:05.450 --> 00:16:07.650
No, this isn't over yet.

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:08.680
What?

00:16:09.180 --> 00:16:11.220
There's still the mystery
of the blue roses.

00:16:21.440 --> 00:16:23.690
Are we having yakisoba tonight?

00:16:23.690 --> 00:16:25.070
Onii-chan.

00:16:25.070 --> 00:16:26.670
Put lots of ginger in it.

00:16:27.050 --> 00:16:28.760
I don't like them.

00:16:29.270 --> 00:16:31.030
The vice president told me everything.

00:16:32.430 --> 00:16:33.370
I'm sorry.

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:41.000
I'm sorry for what I did.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:44.050
I acted out of line, too.

00:16:44.050 --> 00:16:47.230
Tomorrow I'll explain the
situation to everyone.

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:48.490
It's fine.

00:16:48.490 --> 00:16:50.880
I won't be joining the art club anyway.

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:53.160
It seems like it'll just cause you trouble.

00:16:53.430 --> 00:16:54.240
Elis?

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:55.260
It's fine, it's fine.

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:57.730
Elis?

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:12.550
Elis, what's wrong?

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:14.910
Elis!

00:17:15.910 --> 00:17:17.800
Elis? Are you all right?

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:40.840
I don't like red.

00:17:41.800 --> 00:17:44.990
Dad and Mom were covered in red.

00:17:45.980 --> 00:17:49.000
Elis, you...

00:17:50.350 --> 00:17:52.920
I'm sorry I didn't notice.

00:17:56.220 --> 00:17:58.300
Case closed.

00:18:06.320 --> 00:18:07.730
I understand.

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:11.400
I will explain it to everyone.

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:13.060
Thank you.

00:18:13.060 --> 00:18:16.360
How is Hosen-san doing?

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:20.340
She's saying she won't join the art club.

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:22.780
I see. What a shame.

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:23.710
What?

00:18:24.100 --> 00:18:28.060
Those blue roses were painted
with an amazing touch.

00:18:28.060 --> 00:18:30.410
I truly believe it.

00:18:31.260 --> 00:18:32.900
Everyone else probably does, too.

00:18:33.350 --> 00:18:37.890
Their anxiety must have made
them attack Hosen-san.

00:18:38.450 --> 00:18:41.410
She may no longer wish to...

00:18:41.410 --> 00:18:45.590
but I would be delighted if Hosen-san
joined the art club.

00:18:47.010 --> 00:18:50.720
She would make a good rival.

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:56.010
That's what she said.

00:18:56.660 --> 00:18:57.910
What are you going to do?

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:00.780
What do you think?

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:02.290
It's up to you.

00:19:02.290 --> 00:19:06.220
But I might cause more trouble for you.

00:19:06.220 --> 00:19:10.730
Sure, but I've known you
since you were little.

00:19:12.180 --> 00:19:18.500
I believe you're someone who
would never act immorally...

00:19:18.500 --> 00:19:20.100
to lie and deceive others.

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:25.040
Maybe I'll join the art club after all.

00:19:25.300 --> 00:19:27.390
That way I can be with you.

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:30.300
Let's eat.

00:19:30.300 --> 00:19:31.080
Okay.

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:33.020
Thanks for the food.

00:19:35.920 --> 00:19:37.490
What's wrong? Too delicious for you?

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:44.690
How can you screw up
yakisoba this badly?

00:19:44.690 --> 00:19:46.540
What are you talking about?

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:47.720
Just try it.

00:19:47.720 --> 00:19:48.680
Well?

00:19:48.680 --> 00:19:50.700
It's still edible.

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:55.400
She can't use red.

00:19:55.400 --> 00:19:57.410
That's fatal for an artist.

00:19:58.440 --> 00:20:00.430
She's got to overcome it somehow.

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:05.910
Why couldn't you wake up earlier?

00:20:05.910 --> 00:20:08.950
Can't you wake me up more gently?

00:20:08.950 --> 00:20:10.620
But you won't get up unless
I roll you over!

00:20:12.860 --> 00:20:15.090
What's wrong with you?

00:20:30.490 --> 00:20:31.870
This isn't like you.

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:36.810
If you've got something
to say, just say it.

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:39.380
Just be patient.

00:20:40.360 --> 00:20:44.030
I'm not ready yet.

00:20:50.340 --> 00:20:52.160
I like you.

00:20:53.820 --> 00:20:56.600
I like you, Hiroki.

00:21:03.140 --> 00:21:04.710
Say something

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:08.870
Sorry.

00:21:22.870 --> 00:21:23.950
Are you...

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:27.790
Hiroki?

00:23:10.900 --> 00:23:14.140
Mandarin orange is the bittersweet
color of youth.

00:23:14.140 --> 00:23:17.410
Why do men always fall for
their childhood friends?

00:23:17.410 --> 00:23:17.990
Huh?

00:23:17.990 --> 00:23:20.350
You'll get tired of spending
so much time...

00:23:20.350 --> 00:23:22.700
with someone you've known
since childhood.

00:23:22.700 --> 00:23:23.380
You think so?

00:23:23.380 --> 00:23:26.190
When that happens, it'll be too late...

00:23:26.190 --> 00:23:27.860
to regret not keeping your options open.

00:23:27.860 --> 00:23:31.400
Isn't falling for your younger
sister figure the same?

00:23:31.400 --> 00:23:33.210
I might grow tired of you, too.

00:23:33.210 --> 00:23:34.360
Oh, no!

00:23:34.360 --> 00:23:36.490
Next episode, “Mandarin
Orange Reunion.”

00:23:36.490 --> 00:23:39.030
Keep your love interests
within 50 meters.
